00:00:26.628 --> 00:00:27.600
(Joey laughs)

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.040
For free, gentlemen.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.640
- Wait, are we fucking
jumping right into it?

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.820
