the first topic for today,

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.420
but right now, I have with
me the boys, Garnt and Joey,

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.410
and I am monkey-brain Connor.
- You didn't even say hello.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.330
You just fucking opened
up with this like--

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.710
