00:01:00.918 --> 00:01:01.876
Did you just...

00:01:01.876 --> 00:01:03.020
Oh my God. I can't fucking talk today.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.340
- Yeah, he did, he did.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.000
