stumbles on his words.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:06.880
I said free anime.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:07.880
I wasn't stumbling.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.660
- Tell me more, salesman,
who's totally not shady.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.736
- Well, if you just go
to the Kickstarter page.

00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:14.860
(Joey laughs)

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:16.049
- Oh, we're gonna talk about that.

00:01:16.049 --> 00:01:16.882
We're gonna talk about that.

00:01:16.882 --> 00:01:18.131
- Anime Tube, is that what
it's called, Anime Tube?

00:01:18.131 --> 00:01:18.964
- Anime Tube.
- Well,

00:01:18.964 --> 00:01:20.040
it's the first topic for today.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.500
Two weeks ago, we wanted to
talk about this last week,

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.180
but Chris came on,
inconvenienced us again.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.560
We would have spoken about this last week

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.130
- 'Cause we wanted to
talk about Anime Tube.

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:29.480
- We know Chris goes into
fits when we talk about anime.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.350
- So we got, so we're gonna
be like three weeks late,

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.020
but the whole debacle
is kind of finished now.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:32.853
- Yeah.

00:01:32.853 --> 00:01:34.920
- We have all the info.
- Well, it like, lived

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:37.870
and died within the
span of a day, I think.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:38.970
- [Connor] Yes.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:39.803
- Pretty much.

00:01:39.803 --> 00:01:40.650
- It was very interesting.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:42.760
Essentially what happened is
this thing called Anime Tube

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.560
popped up on Kickstarter

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:48.910
and offered to give all
the kind, anyone, really--

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:50.156
- [Group] Free anime.

00:01:50.156 --> 00:01:51.490
- Free anime?

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:52.522
