00:02:01.096 --> 00:02:01.929
(Joey gasps)

00:02:01.929 --> 00:02:04.220
Love Hina, which has been
stuck in copyright Hell,

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.220
not copyright, licensing Hell.

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.780
