00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:10.860
I dunno who just put
specifically picks Love Hina

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.250
to be on the list, but.
- Death Note, Attack on Titan.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.083
- Full Metal Alchemist.
- Demon Slayer.

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:14.950
- Full Metal Alchemist.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:17.040
Even though these were already all on

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.310
streaming platforms already, you know.

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.497
And I imagine that--

00:02:19.497 --> 00:02:21.650
- And the ones that aren't
have been out of print

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:23.993
for the past 20 years.
- They say Re:Zero as well.

00:02:23.993 --> 00:02:25.970
- Ugh, I didn't, I didn't see the list.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:27.664
- They've got everything. It's Anime Tube.

00:02:27.664 --> 00:02:28.497
- You know? I mean, you know,

00:02:28.497 --> 00:02:29.910
and so I can't,

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:31.600
I don't know how much
these properties are worth,

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.020
