00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.030
And it's raised over a
hundred thousand dollars,

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:22.930
promising people free anime legally.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:23.910
And I'm just like,

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.490
what is going on right now?

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.160
It was an absolute disaster.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.398
- April was about three months ago, guys.

00:03:30.398 --> 00:03:31.340
(Garnt laughs)

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:33.230
You're a bit late to the joke right now.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.060
- Yeah. It was just a mess.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.080
- It was hilarious, dude.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:37.956
- It was a mess.

00:03:37.956 --> 00:03:39.285
The, you know,

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.313
I think it's so many levels to it,

00:03:41.313 --> 00:03:43.690
there's so many things that
are really sad about it.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:47.560
One, you know, I think
it's safe to say that

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.870
