00:03:58.810 --> 00:03:59.884
- No, yeah, I mean, you know,

00:03:59.884 --> 00:04:01.150
you have to be careful
when you say these gabs,

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:02.170
you can get sued.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.180
So try not to get Trash
Taste sued here, Joey.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:07.013
But from what I saw, yeah, it's a scam.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:09.264
(Garnt laughs)

00:04:09.264 --> 00:04:10.264
It's a scam.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:12.650
- Well, I'm protecting myself.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.720
I'm not going to say the S word,

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.550
but I'm going to say
that it looked very sus.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:19.431
I'll say the other S word.

00:04:19.431 --> 00:04:20.447
(Joey and Garnt laugh)

00:04:20.447 --> 00:04:21.613
- Little sussy scam.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.393
- It's a sussy baka is what it is.

00:04:25.545 --> 00:04:27.290
- You know, I genuinely wonder because,

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:28.123
you know, again,

00:04:28.123 --> 00:04:30.590
they promised to have all
these titles that there's

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.060
absolutely, you know,

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.946
not even Netflix or Amazon
can get all of these shows,

00:04:34.946 --> 00:04:35.779
