00:04:35.779 --> 00:04:37.770
This is some serious amount of cash

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.410
and negotiating power,

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.020
that I doubt a Kickstarter
would be able to convince

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:44.540
the Japanese investors.
- If Netflix and Sony

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.733
can't even get the
rights to some of these,

00:04:46.733 --> 00:04:49.100
what suggests to anyone that

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.541
this Kickstarter group will be able to?

00:04:50.541 --> 00:04:52.384
- Evangelion literally couldn't be--

00:04:52.384 --> 00:04:54.150
- Evangelion's been out of
print for the past 20 years.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.440
- You couldn't get the license for it

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.560
until Netflix somehow managed,

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.710
