with Gainax to get it back.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.490
- It's insanity.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.760
- Yeah. I mean, the thing is,

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.550
I think there's, as you said,

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.690
