00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.533
You know,

00:05:13.533 --> 00:05:16.160
having somewhere where you
can watch anime legally.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.063
- Truly a utopian society.

00:05:18.063 --> 00:05:19.810
