big guy "ha ha ha, funny."

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.022
But if it was a good
attempt, I would be like,

00:05:28.022 --> 00:05:28.855
"Go for it, go for it!"

00:05:28.855 --> 00:05:30.470
