their money into a void.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.310
- Dude, weebs want free shit, man,

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.150
at the end of the day.
- That's the thing,

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:34.100
this is also what I don't understand,

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.360
