why this would not work

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.767
in the first place or, you know.

00:07:36.767 --> 00:07:38.750
A hundred thousand seems like

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.500
a lot of money to any normal person.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.510
It's like a drop in the fucking bucket

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:46.278
for anime licensing
fees and all that stuff.

00:07:46.278 --> 00:07:48.500
- You can maybe license--

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.550
- Half an episode.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:50.524
- No, no, no, not even that.

00:07:50.524 --> 00:07:51.357
(all laugh)

00:07:51.357 --> 00:07:53.732
- You can maybe license the thumbnail.

00:07:53.732 --> 00:07:56.580
- Half an episode of like a C-tier anime.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.453
- Pretty much, yeah.

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.120
What surprised me is that they were,

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.090
the shows that they were listing

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.403
as the shows they were going for,

00:08:05.403 --> 00:08:08.210
were like the fucking triple A titles

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.550
that are worth millions and
millions of dollars, right?

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.840
I mean, God knows how
much Netflix actually paid

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.450
to get Evangelion out of licensing hell.

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.606
'Cause Evangelion was out of like,

00:08:18.606 --> 00:08:21.770
couldn't be licensed by any
Western company for like,

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.300
feels like a decade or something.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.020
- Literally since it was made.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.601
- Yeah.

00:08:26.601 --> 00:08:28.620
Since ADV collapsed,

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.530
I can't think of any other

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:33.516
company that has successfully
licensed Evangelion.

00:08:33.516 --> 00:08:35.145
- And I think people
like to think of anime

00:08:35.145 --> 00:08:36.520
as still this kind of underground thing,

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.870
but some of these shows
are easily, you know,

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.020
worth over hundreds of
millions of dollars.

00:08:41.871 --> 00:08:44.520
Just think of the merchandising
of these shows as well.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.353
The IP is so expensive.

00:08:45.353 --> 00:08:47.250
- Think about the mega shows,

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.750
